{"title":"Intertemporal substitution (from my email)","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/916909625/0/marginalrevolution~Intertemporal-substitution-from-my-email.html","date":1744999043000,"content":"<blockquote><p>From a Czech newspaper:</p>\r\n<p>Recruitment of new recruits in Russia is skyrocketing. With the prospect of a ceasefire, they want to ‘jump on the last train’</p>\r\n<p>The number of Russians who have decided to join the army has multiplied in recent weeks. Regardless of their health, recruitment centres are taking anyone who expresses an interest. And it is growing even as an increasing number of Russian soldiers return from the front line in coffins. This is mainly due to the high rewards, and with the prospect of a ceasefire, the motivation of new recruits is even higher. Many of them hope to collect money and peace of arms will come before they end up on the front line.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.irozhlas.cz%2Fzpravy-svet%2Fnabor-novych-rekrutu-v-rusku-prudce-stoupa-s-vidinou-primeri-chteji-naskocit-do_2504180600_eku&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C3374729891bf44ab410b08dd7e609bde%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638805675601640540%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=cfwIV2g781oqO76fA0AXyjRgWoE4P09nV1Za8dYw3Q4%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Nábor nových rekrutů v Rusku prudce stoupá | iROZHLAS – spolehlivé zprávy</a></p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That is all from <strong>MR</strong> commentator uair01.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/intertemporal-substitution-from-my-email.html\">Intertemporal substitution (from my email)</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevo